@ 10.3.11.3.5 - Proto-Tanna to Whitesands
# citation: thetha, from Lynch, John (2001), The Linguistic History of Southern Vanuatu
	r → {l,i}
	d → r / _ŋ (occasionally elsewhere as well)
	b(ʷ) d → p(ʷ) t
	kʷ → ∅ / u_
	kʷ → ∅ / _u
	# kʷ / {w,u}
	ɣ → ∅ / {#,E}_
	ɣ → ∅ / _E
	ɣ → ŋ
	c *j → s {z,s}
	s → h “often”
	z → r